<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="2CO" style="id">Lugulu Bible Version</book>
  <para style="h">2 Wakolinto</para>
  <para style="toc1">Ibaluwa ya Keli ya Pauli kwe iwanu wa Kolinto</para>
  <para style="toc2">2 Wakolinto</para>
  <para style="toc3">2 Wako</para>
  <para style="mt2">Ibaluwa ya Keli ya Pauli kwe</para>
  <para style="mt1">Iwanu wa Kolinto</para>
  <para style="imt">Ichilongole</para>
  <para style="ip">Ibaluwa ya keli ya Pauli kwa Wakolinto yandikighwa miyaka ya hamsini na tano mbaka hamsini na sita kulawa Yesu helekighwe (1:1). Aino ibaluwa ya keli yatuli nayo mna tsibaluwa mbili tsayawandikile Wakiristu wa Kolinto. Iwasomi wotoghola ka Pauli tsakalongola ukwandika ibaluwa ingi ya ukali kwa Wakolinto kubita aino ya kabili. Na ibaluwa ayo iyo yoilonga mna isula ya 2:3-4. Lekeni twetwe twahela ibaluwa ayo. Ibaluwa ya keli ya Pauli kwa Wakolinto yolongighwa yandikighwa hayang'ali iyokala Makedoniya (2:13).</para>
  <para style="ip">Mne ibaluwa yake kwa Wakiristu iwali Korinto Pauli kolonga pfayadeng'elele ahala Tito hayamlongele mbuli tse likanisa ilili kuko. Mne ibaluwa yake ayo twomwona Pauli kowalangulitsa Wakorinto wawagholele tsisendi Iwakiristu iwali ako Yelusalemu. Kuya yakoneka tsakulawila walangulitsi wa ughutsu iwadeng'elele ukwisonga kwe wanu iwali mne likanisa ili malangulitso gha Pauli ghoneke si chinu bae. Walangulitsi awo tsawang'ali woghutsa angu Pauli kana ukulu wachi, naye Pauli kawalongela ghendo ukulu iyali nawo ka yeye ka mtumighwa wa Yesu Kiristu hala haimalila ibaluwa yake ya keli kwa Wakorinto.</para>
  <para style="iot">Ighali mno</para>
  <para style="io">Mne isula ya 1:1-7, Pauli kakwandusa ibaluwa yake kwa kuwalamsa Wakiristu wa Korinto.</para>
  <para style="io">Mne isula ya Kuya 1:8-7:16, Pauli kolonga umwanza wake pfaughalamke chayahulike kulawa wao na pfawaidike ibaluwa yake ilongole</para>
  <para style="io">Mne isula ya 8:1-9:15, Pauli kolapfa malaghitso gha ukuchanga tsisendi kwaajili ya wakiristu wa Yerusalemu,</para>
  <para style="io">Mne isula ya 10:1-13:10, Paulo komalitsila kwa kuwamila utumighwa wake na kuwalongela mbuli tsa ukuwangila keli Wakolinto.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Nene Pauli, mtumighwa wa Yesu Kiristu kwa unoghelo we Imulungu, hamwe na ndughu yetu Timoteo twomlamsani.</para>
  <para style="p">Twomwandikilani mwemwe kingili lye iwanu we Imulungu lyose ilili Kolinto, na iwanu wose we Imulungu iwali muisi yose ya Akaya.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v"/>Nomlomba Imulungu Aba wetu na Imtwatsa wetu Yesu Kiristu yawatendele uluso na yamwikeni tseghamba.</para>
  <para style="s">Pauli kolonga mighede kwe Imulungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v"/>Yatunyighwe Imulungu, Aba wa Imtwatsa wetu Yesu Kiristu, Aba wa libatsi na Imulungu iyokanza ghendo. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Imulungu kotukanza mna ghamaghayo ghose, ili tuwakanze awala iwali mne maghayo ghoghose ka Imulungu pfayotukanza twetwe. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Ka ghamaghayo gha Yesu pfaghokongetseka mghati mwetu, pfipfo pfatughendelela kukanzighwa na Kiristu. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Tung'aghanzika, twoghanzika ili mwemwe mwapfilighwe na mkombolighwe. Tung'akanzighwa, namwe pfipfila mwokanzighwa na mwakwing'ighwa ngupfu mdudumile maghayo ghaghano ghatududumila. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Lolelo lyatuli nalyo kuna mwemwe kulu sideke, kwaapfila twomanya ghendo mwoghaya na pfipfila mwokanzighwa ka twetwe pfatukanzighwa. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Ng'atubama bae mwemwe mleke kumanya maghayo ghatupatile muisi ya Asiya. Ghamaghayo agho tsaghabita ngupfu tsetu mbaka tsatupfikitsa ng'atuhona bae. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Lekeni mne imimoyo yetu tsatupfikitsa ka tuighighwa kufa. Ilawila apfo ili tuleke kwihuhila wenyegho, ila tumuhuhile Imulungu iyowatsilihula iwanu iwafile. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Tsakatukombola mne ghamaghayo ing'aghadahile kutukoma, naye katsotukombola. Na twetwe twomlolela yeye ka katsoghendelela kutukombola. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Mwemwe mng'atwapfila kwa kutulombela. Ukutulombela kwenu ng'ani kutsakwidikighwa, na Imulungu katsotubaliki, kuya iwanu wengi watsolonga mighede kwe Imulungu kwaajili ya twetwe.</para>
  <para style="s">Paulo kolamla kukawa kwangila Korinto</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>Twetwe tweghodela chinu chimwe, mimoyo yetu yotulangusa ka kukala kwetu muisi amu, hasa na mwemwe, tukala kwa uhenzeluka na ghumoyo ghunoghile ghwatwing'ighwe ne Imulungu. Ng'atulongotsighwe ne tsimbutsi tse iwanu bae, ila twolongotsighwa ne uluso we Imulungu. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Mana ng'atukwandika bae chinu chochose mwemwe chang'amdaha bae kuchisoma au kuchimanya. Nololela mtsomanya pfinoghile ghendo, <verse number="14" style="v"/>hata ka mbaka sambi mwomanya chidogho, hambele mtsomanya ghendo na mtseghoda kwaajili ya twetwe, ka twetwe pfatwitseghoda kwaajili ya mwemwe mne litsuwa lya Imtwatsa wetu Yesu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>Aku ng'ala nololela agho. tsambama ghendo tanu kumwangilani mwemwe, ili mbwede lwakeli. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Tsambama kumwangilani hanibita kughenda Makedoniya na kuya kuna mwemwe hanilawa Makedoniya, ili mnyapfile mne ghumwanza wangu kughenda Yudeya. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Pfii hanibamile kutenda apfi, tsanikala chigeugeu? Ebu ghanitenda notenda kwa mbutsi tse chimunu, na hanilonga, “Ona, ona” na hanilonga, “Bae, bae”? <verse number="18" style="v"/>Lekeni ka Imulungu pfoyotogholighwa, usenga wetu kuna mwemwe si mbuli ya kulonga “Ona” na “Bae”, chipindi chicho. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Kwaapfila Kiristu Yesu, Imwana we Imulungu, yapetelighwe kuna mwemwe na Silivani na Timoteo na nene mwenyegho ng'awile “Ona” na “Bae.” Lekeni mna yeye kuna “Ona” iliyeka matsuwa ghose, <verse number="20" style="v"/>kwaapfila chila chinu Imulungu chayalaghane kubitila Yesu chakuwa “Ona,” mna Kiristu. Apfo “Amina” yetu yolongighwa kubitila yeye, kwa utunitso we Imulungu. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Lelo iyotutenda twetwe na mwemwe twime pfinoghile mna Kiristu, na iyatusaghule, iyo Imulungu mwenyegho, <verse number="22" style="v"/>naye katughela ichitango ichilangusa ka twetwe twawakwake, na katwing'a Muhe wake mna imimoyo yetu yaghwe tsamana kwa aghala ghose ighotutsila.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>Imulungu iyo mkalangama wangu yeye kaghumanya ghumoyo wangu! Nene sitsile keli bae Kolinto kwa kuwonelani mwemwe libatsi. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Ng'atubama kuwananahitsa mne ukutoghola kwenu, twetwe twomanya mwemwe mwima pfinoghile mne ukutoghola, lekeni twosang'ana hamwe na mwemwe kwa ndeng'elelo yenu.</para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Apfo nilamla ndeke kumwangilani keli na kuwaghuma usungu. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Ning'awaghuma usungu, nani lelo yatsonenda ndeng'elele? Ng'ambe wawala niwaghumile usungu! <verse number="3" style="v"/>Niwandikilani mbuli ayo ili hanikutsa ndeke kughumighwa usungu na awala iwabamighwe kunitenda ndeng'elele. Nomanya ghendo nene ning'adeng'elela, namwe wose mtsodeng'elela pfipfila. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Niwandikilani kwa usungu mkulu aku nisusuwala na masotsi ghondawa, sibamile bae kuwaghuma usungu, lekeni kuwatenda mmanye pfaniwanoghela sideke.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>Imunu wowose ang'amghuma imunu usungu, ng'anighumile nene niliheka bae, ila kawaghuma usungu mwemwe wose, nene sibama niwe mkali ng'ani. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Kubaghulighwa kwayabaghulighwe imunu ayo ne iwanu wengi kumkolela. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Namwe mwobamighwa mumleghusile totso lyake na mumghume ghumoyo ili aleke kona usungu sideke, na aleke kuya kuchughu ghendo. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Apfo nowalomba, mumlanguse ka mwemwe mwomnoghela ghendo. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Tsaniwandikilani ibaluwa ila kwaapfila tsambama kumanya ka mwodaha kunitegheletsa mna chila chinu chanilonga. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Mng'amleghusila imunu totso lyake, nene pfipfila nomleghusila totso lyake. Kwaapfila ning'amleghusila imunu totso lyake, nimleghusila hambele he Kiristu kwaajili ya mwemwe <verse number="11" style="v"/>ili tuleke kumleka Setani yatubughe, kwaapfila twomanya chayobama kutenda.</para>
  <para style="s">Paulo kakwalangula kakala mne isi ya Troa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>Lelo hanipfikile Tirowa kupeta Imbuli Inoghile ya Kiristu, Imtwatsa kangoloselela inzila nisang'ane ng'onde yake. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Lekeni tsanighaya mmoyo mwangu kwaapfila simpfikile bae ndughu yangu Tito, apfo niwaagha iwanu ng'enda Makedoniya.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>Lekeni mighede kwe Imulungu iyotutenda tuhume ghamatsuwa ghose kubitila Kiristu, na kubitila twetwe itukwenetsa imbuli ye ukummanya Kiristu chila hanu hatumsang'anila ka nung'o inoghile. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Kwaapfila hambele he Imulungu, twetwe twa nung'o inoghile ya Kiristu kwa awala iwokombolighwa na kwa awala iwakwagha. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Kwa awala iwakwagha, twetwe twa nung'o iighala lifwa, na kwa wamwenga iwokombolighwa twetwe twa nung'o iighala ughima, lelo yuhi yodaha ing'onde ayo? <verse number="17" style="v"/>Twetwe si ka iwanu wamwenga bae iwochuhutsa Imbuli ye Imulungu, lekeni mghati mwa Kiristu twetwe twa iwanu iwolongesa hambele he Imulungu, ka iwanu iwatumighwe ne Imulungu.</para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Iwatumwa wa laghano lya sambi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Angu twakwandutsa keli kwitunya iwenyegho? Au twobama baluwa itsitutoghola kutsa kuna mwemwe, au baluwa tso ukutoghola kulawa kuna mwemwe, ka iwanu wangi pfawotenda? <verse number="2" style="v"/>Mwemwe muwenyegho mwa ibaluwa yetu, iyandikighwe mmimoyo mwetu, yomanyika na yosomighwa na chila imunu. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Pfimanyika ka mwemwe mwa baluwa ya Kiristu, iilawile mne sang'ano yetu, ayo ng'ayandikighwe bae kwa lwino ila kwa Ghumuhe we Imulungu iyali mghima, na si mne lwala lwe libwe bae, ila mne imimoyo ye iwanu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v"/>Na lolelo alyo tunalyo hambele he Imulungu kubitila Kiristu. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Kuduhu ichinu chochose ichitutenda tulonge ka twodaha kusang'ana ng'onde ino, lekeni ukudaha kwetu kolawa kwe Imulungu. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Ayo iyo yuyo iyatutendile tudahe kutumikila laghano lya sambi, na si laghano lya ghamalaghitso bae, ila laghano lya Ghumuhe Mwenzeluka. Mana ghamalaghitso ighandikighwe ghoghala lifwa, ila Ghumuhe Mwenzeluka koghala ughima.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v"/>Lelo ka ghamalaghitso ighaghalile lifwa, ghala ighandikighwe mne ghamabwe ghatsa na utunitso, mbaka Waisiraeli ng'awadahile bae kuchilola chihanga cha Musa kwaajili ya ukung'ala kwake, nawo tsaukala utunitso iuhupa, <verse number="8" style="v"/>pfii lelo sang'ano ya Ghumuhe ng'aitsokuwa ya utunitso mkulu bae? <verse number="9" style="v"/>Ka isang'ano iiwahigha iwanu tsaikala na utunitso mkulu, apfi isang'ano iighala ughima si ng'ulu bae kubita ayo? <verse number="10" style="v"/>Lelo utunitso mkulu ghendo ughubika utunitso ula wo ghumwande, hata ka utunitso awo tsawoneka mkulu, lekeni sambi uhupa. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Mana ka achila ichikalile chidogho tsachikala na utunitso, pfii lelo achila ichikala ghamatsuwa ghose, ambe chitsakuwa na utunitso mkulu ghendo!</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>Kwaapfila tuna lolelo alyo, twolonga bila kupfuka. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Twetwe si ka Musa bae, iyaghubike chihanga chake kwa lighwanda ili iwanu wa Isiraeli waleke kona ukumala kwe ukung'ala kula. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Lekeni tsimbutsi tsao tsatsighubikighwa. Kwaapfila mbaka leloli halisomighwa laghano lya ghumwande chighubiko acho chabaho chighubika mbutsi tsawo. Cholapfighwa hala imunu ang'amtoghola Kiristu. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Hata leloli hawosoma Malaghitso gha Musa, chighubiko choghubika mbutsi tsao. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Lekeni chighubiko acho cholapfighwa ahala imunu ang'amuyila Imtwatsa. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Lelo Imtwatsa ka Ghumuhe, na hane Ghumuhe we Imtwatsa, hana ukulekelighwa. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Lekeni twetwe wose tune pfihanga ing'apfighubikwe bae, twakona ka mne chilolelo utunitso we Imtwatsa, na twetwe twotendighwa twighale naye kwa kongetseka mne utunitso iulawa kwe Imtwatsa, ayo iyo Ghumuhe.</para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Ng'atukuya kuchugho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Kwa libatsi lyake Imulungu katwing'a isang'ano ino, apfo ng'atukuya kuchughu bae. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Lekeni tupfileka pfinu pfose pfa chinyala na pfa chinyelenyele. Ng'atukala bae kwa ukubugha na ng'atughela ughutsu bae mne mbuli ye Imulungu, ila kwa kuulangusa ukweli, tweika hasi mwe malamutsi ghe mimoyo ye iwanu hambele he Imulungu. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Hata ka imbuli inoghile yotuwapetela ipfisika, ipfisika kwa awala iwakwagha waliheka. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Hawo ng'awotoghola bae kwaapfila imulungu yehile we isi ino katsighuma ichisi tsimbutsi tsawo waleke kuwona ghumwanga we Imbuli Inoghile ye utunitso wa Kiristu, iyeghalile ghendo ne Imulungu. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Kwaapfila ng'atwipeta bae iwenyegho, ila twompeta Yesu Kiristu ka Imtwatsa, na twetwe iwenyegho ka watumwa wenu kwaajili ya Yesu. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Imulungu yuyula iyalongile, “Ghumwanga ghulangatse kulawa mchisi,” iyo yuyo iyoilangatsa imimoyo yetu, na kutwing'a ghumwanga wo ukumanya utunitso we Imulungu iulang'atsa mchihanga mwa Yesu Kiristu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v"/>Lekeni twetwe ituli na hatsina lino tweghala na ipfiha pfa lidongo, ili yoneke ka ingupfu ayo ng'ulu yolawa kwe Imulungu, wala ng'ailawa kuna twetwe bae. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Twokandamitsighwa chila ubali, lekeni ng'atuhondeka bae, twopfuka lekeni ng'atukuya kuchughu, <verse number="9" style="v"/>twoghanzika, lekeni twokwapfilighwa, twokwasighwa hasi, lekeni ng'atulaghighwa bae. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Matsuwa ghose twosola lifwa lya Yesu mlukuli mwetu, ili ughima wa Yesu pfipfila woneka mne ng'uli tsetu. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Mana twetwe yatuli waghima, ghamatsuwa ghose twolapfighwa tufe kwaajili ya Yesu ili ughima wake woneke mne ng'uli tsetu itsikufa. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Apfo lifwa lyosang'ana mghati mwetu, lekeni ughima wosang'ana mghati mwenu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>Ghamaandiko Maenzeluka gholonga, “Tsanitoghola, ndo mana tsanilonga.” Na twetwe pfipfila kwa muhe uhula wa ukutoghola, twotoghola na twolonga. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Kwaapfila twomanya ghendo Imulungu iyamtsilihule Imtwatsa Yesu, pfipfila katsotutsilihula twetwe na Yesu, na kutwika hamwe namwe hambele hake. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Kwaapfila agha ghose ghatendeka kwaajili ya mwemwe, ili uluso we Imulungu hauwapfikila iwanu wengi ng'ani, utsowatenda iwanu walonge mighede na ukumtunya Imulungu kwongetseke.</para>
  <para style="s">Kukala kwa inoghola</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>Apfo ng'atukuya kuchughu bae, hata ka ng'uli tsetu tsolala, lekeni mghati muhe tsetu tsotendighwa tsa sambi chila litsuwa. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Kwaapfila ghamaghayo ghatughaya mabewe na ghokala chidogho, lekeni ghatsotwing'a utunitso wa ghamatsuwa ghose iukongetseka ng'ani. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Apfo tuleke kulola ng'ani aghala ighakoneka, ila tulole aghala ing'aghakoneka bae. Kwaapfila aghala ighakoneka ng'aghokala bae, lekeni aghala ing'aghakoneka ghokala ghamatsuwa ghose.</para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Kwaapfila lelo twomanya ka chibumbulika chotukala hano muisi ching'ahinyika, Imulungu katsotwing'a ing'anda ingi kulanga, ing'anda ya ghamatsuwa ghose ing'aitsengighwe bae kwa ghamoko ghe iwanu. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Kwaapfila sambi twoghutilila, aku twololela kwa kusulukila ghendo ukupata lukuli lwa kulanga, <verse number="3" style="v"/>kwaapfila hatutsopata lukuli lwa kulanga, ng'atutsakoneka twahela lukuli bae. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Hatung'ali twokala mne chibumbulika chino che isi twoghutilila na kuhondighwa, ng'atubama bae kulutsula lukuli luno ulukufa, ila twobama kupfatsighwa lukuli ing'alukufa bae, ili achila ichikufa chighalusighwe ghendo chiwe na ughima wa ghamatsuwa ghose. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Imulungu imwenyegho iyo yatutendile pfinu apfo, naye katwing'a Ghumuhe wake yawe nzamana kwa aghala ghose ghayatwikile.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>Apfo ghamatsuwa ghose twoghumighwa ghumoyo na twomanya ghendo tung'akala mna lukuli luno luliheka, twokala kutali na ukaye yetu kwe Imtwatsa. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Twokala kwa inoghola, na si kwa aghala ghatukona bae. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Lekeni tughumighwa ghumoyo na twobama kukala kutali na lukuli, tukale hamwe ne Imtwatsa. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Lekeni chinu chikulu ghendo, twobama kumdeng'eletsa, tung'awa hano muisi au tung'awa hako. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Kwaapfila twetwe wose twobamighwa twime hambele he Kiristu, tuhighighwe naye, na chila imunu katsobokela achila chayobamighwa kubokela kwa aghala ghayatendile hayakalile muisi, ghawe ghanogha au gheha.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>Kwaapfila twomanya kumpfuka Imtwatsa chinu chachi, apfo twotenda ka pfatudaha wakwegha iwanu. Imulungu kotumanya pfinoghile, nani nololela mwemwe pfipfila mwotumanya pfinoghile mne imimoyo yenu. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Ng'atubama bae kwitunya keli hambele henu. Lekeni twomwing'ani nyafasi ye ukwighoda kwaajili ya twetwe ili mdahe kuwedika awala iweghodela ighakoneka ne tsinenge kubita aghala ighali mmoyo. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Hata ka twakoneka tuna lukwale, tuna lukwale kwaajili ye Imulungu na mbutsi tsetu tsinogha kwaajili ya mwemwe. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Mana unoghelo wa Kiristu wotulongotsa, sambi twotanga ka imunu yumwe tsakafa kwaajili ya wose, apfo wose tufa hamwe naye. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Yeye tsakafa kwaajili ya wose, ili awala iwali waghima waleke kukala kwaajili yawo wenyegho, ila kwaajili ya yeye iyafile kwaajili yawo na iyatsilihulighwe.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>Apfo kulawa sambi na kughendelela ng'atummanya bae imunu kwa kumlolesa. Hata ka tsatummanya Yesu Kiristu kwa kumlolesa, lekeni sambi ng'atutenda apfo keli. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Apfo, imunu ang'awa mghati mwa Kiristu, ayo ka chilumbe cha sambi, ghumwande ghahupa, ghawa gha sambi. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Agha ghose ghalawa kwe Imulungu iyatulamlitse twetwe naye imwenyegho kubitila Kiristu na kutwing'a ing'onde yo ukuwalamlitsa iwanu ne Imulungu. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Imulungu tsakakala mghati mwa Kiristu tsakailamlitsa iisi na yeye, bila ukupeta nzambi tse iwanu. Naye katwing'a usenga wo ukuwalamlitsa iwanu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v"/>Apfo twetwe twosang'ana ka iwanu iwatumighwe ne Kiristu, twolonga ka Imulungu mwenyegho iyolonga kubitila twetwe. Kuya twetwe twomlombani ghendo, mwilamlitse ne Imulungu. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Kiristu tsang'akalile na nzambi bae, lekeni Imulungu kamtenda yabape nzambi tsetu, ili twetwe kwa kwilunga naye, tudahe kuwa iwanu wanoghile hambele he Imulungu.</para>
  <chapter number="6" style="c"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Mne sang'ano yetu ne Imulungu, twomlombani mleke kuuleka uluso we Imulungu wambokele waghe hela. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Mana Imulungu kolonga,</para>
  <para style="q">“Mne chipindi cha libatsi lyangu tsaniwahulika,</para>
  <para style="q">mne litsuwa lya ukukombola tsanimwapfilani.”</para>
  <para style="m">Nowalongelani, sambi chicho chipindi cha libatsi lye Imulungu, leloli ilo litsuwa lya ukukombolighwa!</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v"/>Ili sang'ano yetu ileke kwoneka si chinu bae, ng'atubama kumwikila imunu wowose chikwatso, <verse number="4" style="v"/>ila kwa chila chinu chatusang'ana twelangusa twetwe twa iwatumighwa we Imulungu kwa ukududumila ukughanzika na maghayo ghose. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Tsatutwowighwa, twohighwa, tutwowighwa ne iwanu, tusang'ana sang'ano ng'omu, ng'atuwasile bae, tukala ne nzala. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Tsatwilangusa ka twa iwatumwa we Imulungu kwa kukala kwa ukudegheta, kwa ukumanya, kwa ukududumila, kwa ghumoyo ghunoghile na kwa Ghumuhe Mwenzeluka na kwa unoghelo ulihela ung'enye, <verse number="7" style="v"/>na kwa usenga wetu iulongesa na kwa ngupfu ye Imulungu. Haki iyo isilaha yetu mne ghumoko ghwe kujilo na ghumoko ghwe kumoso. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Twiyandaa ukutogholighwa na ukubetsighwa, ukulongighwa na ukutunyighwa. Twakoneka ka waghutsu, lekeni twolongesa, <verse number="9" style="v"/>ka iwanu ing'awomanyika, lekeni twomanyika na wose, tutowighwa lekeni ng'atukomighwe bae, ka iwanu iwafile, lekeni ka pfamkona twetwe twa waghima ghendo. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Hata ka tuna usungu, lekeni ghamatsuwa ghose twodeng'elela, hata ka twakoneka ka wahingwa, ila twoweng'a mali iwanu wengi, hata ka twakoneka twahela chinu, lekeni tuna chila chinu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>Mwemwe ndughu tsetu Wakolinto, tsatuwalongelani ghose mwatsimwatsi na imimoyo yetu ipfughuka kuna mwemwe. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Si twetwe bae yatuhindile imimoyo yetu kuna mwemwe, ila mwemwe iwo yamuhindile imimoyo yenu kuna twetwe. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Lelo nolonga namwe ka wanangu, mfughule imimoyo ka twetwe pfatutendile.</para>
  <para style="s">Mleke kwilunga ne iwanu ing'awomtoghola Imulungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>Mleke kwilunga ne iwanu wala ing'awomtoghola bae Imulungu, angu ghanoghile na ghehile ghodaha kukala hamwe? Ghumwanga na ichisi pfidahatse kukala hamwe? <verse number="15" style="v"/>Apfi Kiristu na Setani wetegheletsa? Lelo imunu iyomtoghola Kiristu na ing'ayomtoghola Kiristu wana usale wachi? <verse number="16" style="v"/>Apfi Ing'anda ye Imulungu ina usale wachi ne ipfinyagho ipfitamanilighwa? Kwaapfila twetwe twa ing'anda ye Imulungu iyali mghima, ka Imulungu mwenyegho pfayalongile,</para>
  <para style="q">“Nitsokala nawo na kwanga mghati mwao,</para>
  <para style="q">nitsakuwa Imulungu wao,</para>
  <para style="q">nawo watsakuwa iwanu wangu.”</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="17" style="v"/>Kuya Imtwatsa kolonga,</para>
  <para style="q">“Mlawe mna wawo</para>
  <para style="q">mwibaghule nawo.</para>
  <para style="q">Mleke kukinda chinu chihile,</para>
  <para style="q">na nene nitsowabokela.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>Imtwatsa yane Ngupfu kolonga,</para>
  <para style="q">nene nitsakuwa Aba wenu,</para>
  <para style="q">namwe mtsakuwa wanangu wamale na wapinga.”</para>
  <chapter number="7" style="c"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Sale tsangu, kwaapfila tunagho malaghano. Apfo twideghete kulawa mna ghose ighoutenda ghumuhe na lukuli wihe, tuwe wenzeluka ghendo kwa kumpfuka Imulungu.</para>
  <para style="s1">Ukudeng'elela kwa Pauli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v"/>Twing'eni uleghelo mna imimoyo yenu. ng'atumtotsele imunu wowose, ng'atumlaghile imunu wala ng'atumghutsukile imunu wowose bae. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Silonga agha bae kwa kuwahighani mwemwe, ka pfanongole kulonga, mwemwe mwamghati mwe imimoyo yetu, hatukufa au hatukala waghima. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Nene nowatogholani, neghoda kwaajili ya mwemwe! Mne ghamaghayo ghetu ghose noghumighwa ghumoyo na nodeng'elela sideke.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>Kwaapfila hata hatupfikile Makedoniya, ng'atubwihile bae. Tsatupata maghayo chila hanu, kunze ughobo, mne imimoyo ukupfuka. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Lekeni Imulungu iyowakanza iwabeneke ghumoyo, tsakatukanza hayatsile Tito. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Wala si kwa kutsa kwake kuliheka bae, ila pfipfila tsakatulongela pfamumkanzile yeye. Tsakatulongela pfambama ghendo kumbona, pfamli na usungu mkulu kwa aghala ighalawile na pfambama kunyamila, apfo nodeng'elela sideke.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v"/>Hata ka niwaghuma usungu kwe baluwa ila, nene sijuta bae. Hata ka ning'ajutile, nakona ibaluwa ayo imwing'ani usungu lekeni kwa chipindi chidodo. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Lekeni sambi nodeng'elela, si kwaapfila tsaniwaghuma usungu, lekeni kwaapfila usungu wenu uwatenda mwemwe mghaluke na kuleka nzambi. Kwaapfila tsamwona usungu ka pfayabamile Imulungu, apfo twetwe ng'atuwalaghileni bae. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Usungu iughalighwa ne Imulungu woghalusa ghumoyo, na kughala ukombotsi ulihela majuto. Lekeni usungu we chimunu womghala imunu mlifwa. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Lelo mlole usungu iughalighwe ne Imulungu chautendile kuna mwemwe, mwemwe sambi muwa iwanu we ibidii, pfambama kulangusa mimoyo yenu pfainoghile, mwakwiduka na kwalangula, pfomninoghela kumbona na pfamwilapfa mwobama kona ihaki yotendeka. Mwemwe mlangusa ghendo ka mwahela totso mne chinu chino.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>Apfo hata ka nyandika ibaluwa ila si kwaajili ya yula yatotsile au yula yatotselighwe, ila nyandika apfo ili kumwikileni mwatsi hambele he Imulungu ili mwone pfamwilapfa kwaajili ya twetwe. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Apfo tughumighwa ghumoyo.</para>
  <para style="p">Si ka tughumighwa ghumoyo ghuliheka, ila Tito tsakatudeng'eletsa ghendo kwa ndeng'elelo ng'ulu yakalile nayo kwa pfamumtendile yasangalale. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Nene tsanighoda hambele hake kwaajili yenu namwe ng'amnighumile chinyala bae. Lekeni chila chinu chatuwalongele tsatulongesa, na kuwaghodelani mwemwe hambele ha Tito tsachikala chinu cha kulongesa. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Unoghelo wake kuna mwemwe mkulu sideke, hayokumbuka pfamtegheletse, pfamumbokele kwa kupfuka na kudedema. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Nodeng'elela ng'ani kwaapfila nodaha kuwahuwila mwemwe ghendo.</para>
  <chapter number="8" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Ukulapfa kwa Uluso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Ndughu tsangu, twobama kuwalongela uluso we Imulungu waweng'ighwe iwanu we Imulungu wa Makedoniya. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Tsawaghetsighwa ng'ani kwa ghamaghayo, lekeni ndeng'elo yawo ighwa ng'ulu na iwatenda wawe waluso sideke hata ka tsawahela chinu. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Nowalongela ghendo tsawalapfa pfawadahile, kuya hata kubita pfawadahile. Kuduhu imunu iyawalongele ila tsawabama iwenyegho, <verse number="4" style="v"/>tsawatulomba ghendo tusang'ane nawo kuwapfila iwanu we Imulungu iwali Yudea. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Ng'awatendile bae ka pfatulolele, ila welapfa iwenyegho tanu kwe Imtwatsa, kuya kuna twetwe ka Imulungu pfayabamile. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Apfo tumlomba Tito, iyandusile sang'ano ayo yawapfile mwemwe muimalitse ing'onde ayo ya unoghelo mghati mwenu. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Mwemwe mwotenda ghoya mne chila chinu, mna ukutoghola, na mwodaha kulonga, mwoghendelela ukusang'ana ghanoghile, mwotunoghela. Apfo twowalomba muwe na unoghelo mkulu mna isang'ano ino ya ukulapfa. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Silonga bae ka laghitso, ila nobama kughetsa unoghelo wenu ka wa kweli, na weghala na iwanu wangi. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Kwaapfila twomanya uluso we Imtwatsa wetu Yesu Kiristu, yeye tsakakala na chila chinu kulanga, lekeni tsaketenda mhingwa kwaajili yenu, ili kubitila uhingwa wake mwemwe muwe na mali.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v"/>Lekeni chanibama kuwalongela achino hano, pfinogha kumalitsa aghala ghamwanzile ghumwaka ghupfosile. Mwemwe tsamkala wamwanduso kulamla na kutenda apfo. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Lelo mmalitse isang'ano yo kulapfa, muwe na usulukilo ghendo kuimalitsa ka pfambamile, mlapfe kwa kulola aghala ghamlinagho. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Mana ka imunu kobama kulapfa, Imulungu katsobokela acho choyolapfa kwa kulola achila chayalinacho, na si kwa kulola achila chayalihela.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>Mwemwe ng'ambamighwa bae mghaye ili wamwenga wabwede, ichibamighwa wose mwilingane. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Chochose chamlinacho sambi ichitsidile chiwapfile awala iwalihela, ili nawo hawatsakuwa napfo wamwing'eni mwemwe hamtsohungukighwa, kuya wose mtsolingana. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Ka pfayandikighwe, “Ayula yakungile pfingi ng'akalile na pfingi bae, na ayula yakungile chidogho ng'ahungukighwe chinu bae.”</para>
  <para style="s">Tito kotumighwa Korinto</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>Nolonga mighede kwe Imulungu yamwing'ile Tito ghumoyo we kumwapfilani ka pfanili nene. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Si ka tsakachitoghola chatulombile chiliheka, ila pfipfila imwenyegho tsakabama sideke kumwapfilani, mbaka kalamla imwenyegho kutsa kuna mwemwe. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Kuya hamwe na Tito tumtuma ndughu yumwe iyatunyighwe na makingili ghose ghe iwanu we Imulungu kwa ing'onde yake ya kuwapetela iwanu Imbuli Inoghile. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Kubita agho, Yeye kasaghulighwa na makingili ghe iwanu we Imulungu yange na twetwe hatuwaghalila iwanu nambiko ino ya unoghelo, isang'ano yotuitenda kwa utunitso we Imtwatsa na kulangusa ka twobama kuwapfila iwanu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v"/>Ng'atubama bae imunu yatunung'unikile pfatulitumila ghweko lino lya uluso. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Mana chotubama twetwe kusang'ana ghanoghile, si kwe Imtwatsa yaliheka bae, ila hata kwe iwanu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>Apfo twomtuma ndughu yetu hamwe nawo, iyatumghetsile na kumtoghola, naye kobama sideke kumwapfilani, na sambi kosulukila sideke kwaapfila kowatogholani sideke. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Tito ka myangu, twetwe twosang'ana hamwe kwaajili ya mwemwe. Lekeni ndughu tsetu wano iwakutsa naye, wawo watumighwa na makingili ghe iwanu we Imulungu, nawo womtunya Kiristu. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Lelo muwalanguse iwanu awo unoghelo wenu, ili makingili ghe iwanu we Imulungu ghamanye ka twolongesa hatwighoda kwaajili ya mwemwe.</para>
  <chapter number="9" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Kuwapfila Wakiristu wangi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Nene sibama bae kumwandikilani mwemwe iwanu we Imulungu imbuli ye sang'ano ino. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Kwaapfila nomanya pfambama ghendo kuwapfila iwanu we Imulungu ako Yudea, na tsanighoda kwaajili ye chinu acho kwe iwanu wa Makedoniya. Tsanimlongelani ka iwanu wa Akaya tsaweandaa kulapfa kulawa ghumwaka ghubitile. Apfo ghumoyo ghwenu wo ukulapfa ghuwatenda iwanu wengi nawo walapfe. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Apfo nowatuma iwandughu awo ili ukwighoda kwetu kwaajili ya mwemwe kuleke kuwa hela. Lekeni ka pfanongile, mwiyandae ukwapfila. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Kwaapfila iwanu wa Makedoniya hawatsakutsa na nene na kuwapfika mwemwe ng'amwiyandae bae, tutsakona chinyala kwaapfila tsatwighoda sideke kwaajili ya mwemwe, namwe pfipfila mtsakona chinyala. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Apfo mbona pfinogha kuwalomba ndughu wano wanongole kutsa kuna mwemwe, ili weke ghoya maghweko ghatwilaghane, na itsolangusa ka mwolapfa kwaapfila mwobama na si ka mnanaitsighwa.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>Lekeni mkumbuke mbuli ino, iyohanda chidogho kopfuna chidogho, iyohanda nyingi kopfuna nyingi. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Chila imunu yalapfe achila chayalamle mmoyo mwake, na hayolapfa aleke kuwa na pfondogholo ka imunu iyananaitsighwe kulapfa. Kwaapfila Imulungu komnoghela imunu iyolapfa kwa uluso. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Imulungu kodaha kumwing'ani kubita agha ighambama ili matsuwa ghose muwe na ghose ghambama, na mwongetseke kwa chila sang'ano inoghile yamtenda. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Ka Ghamaandiko Mahenzeluka pfagholonga,</para>
  <para style="q">“Yeye koweng'a iwahingwa kwa uluso,</para>
  <para style="q">Uluso wake wokala matsuwa ghose.”</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="10" style="v"/>Imulungu iyomwing'agha imbeghu ayula iyohanda na iyomwing'agha ichijo, pfipfila katsomwing'ani mwemwe mbeghu tsambama, kuya katsotsitenda tsote, naye katsakongetsa ghamapfuno kwa uluso wenu. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Namwe mtsobweda kwa chila chinu ili muwe na uluso chila litsuwa, na kubitila twetwe iwanu watsolonga mighede kwe Imulungu kwa uluso wenu. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Kwaapfila isang'ano ino iyamsang'ana ng'aitsowapfila bae iwanu we Imulungu waliheka, ila itsowatenda iwanu wengi wamlongele Imulungu mighede ghendo. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Na kwa chailangusa sang'ano yenu ayo, iwanu watsomtunya Imulungu kwa kutegheletsa kwenu na kuitoghola Imbuli Inoghile ya Kiristu. Pfipfila kwa uluso wenu wamuwatendela wawo ne iwanu wose. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Apfo watsowalombelani kwa ghumoyo ghwawo ghose, kwa uluso mkulu wamtendeleni Imulungu. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Tulonge mighede kwa Imulungu kwa ghweko lyake kulu sideke!</para>
  <chapter number="10" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Pauli koyamila isang'ano yake</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Nene mwenyegho Pauli iyanikoneka nihola hanikala namwe, lekeni na mkali hanikala kutali namwe ka iwanu wangi pfawolonga, nowalombani kwa libatsi na uluso wa Kiristu. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Nowalombani mleke kunenda niwe mkali hanikutsa, kwaapfila nolongesa ghendo nodaha kuwa mkali kwa awala wose iwotwona twetwe twokala ka iwanu we iisi ino. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Hata ka twokala muisi, ng'atwitowa bae ka iwanu we iisi pfawetowa. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Kwaapfila tsisilaha tsatwitowela si tsisilaha tse iisi bae, ila ngupfu ye Imulungu iihinya boma lyose lye iwotuhila. Twotsihinya mbuli tsose tse ughutsu, <verse number="5" style="v"/>na kubomola chila chinu ichighoda ichikighwe kuighoma Imbuli ye Imulungu; na kutsitenda mbutsi tsose tsimtegheletse Kiristu. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Mwemwe hamkomala mna ukutegheletsa chila chinu, twetwe twiyandaa kumuhigha chila munu iyolema kutegheletsa.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v"/>Mwemwe mwolola ipfinu kwa kunze kuliheka. Pfii hana imunu iyebona ka yeye munu wa Kiristu? Pfinogha, naye pfipfila yatwone ka twetwe pfipfila twa iwanu wa Kiristu ka yeye pfayali imunu wa Kiristu. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Hata ka neghoda sideke kwa uwetso iyatwing'ile Imtwatsa wa kuwatsenga na si wa kuwabomola bae, sikona chinyala bae. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Sibama bae mboneke ka nobama kuwatenda mpfuke kwa tsibaluwa tsangu. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Imunu kodaha kulonga, “Tsibaluwa tsa Pauli ng'ali na tsina mbuli nito, lekeni yeye mwenyegho hayokala na twetwe kahela ngupfu na ghayolonga ka si chinu bae.” <verse number="11" style="v"/>Imunu iyolonga apfo yatange ghendo ka aghala ghatukwandika hatuli kutali gheghala na aghala ighatutenda hatuli namwe.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>Ng'atubama bae kwiika au kwighala ne iwanu wala iwetunya wenyegho. Iwanu iwelinga wenyegho kwa wenyegho na iweghala wenyegho kwa wenyegho, awo wa wabotsi. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Twetwe, ng'atutsolumbilila bae ukwighoda, ukwighoda kwetu kutsokala mna ing'onde iyatwing'ile Imulungu, ing'onde iipfikile mbaka kuna mwemwe. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Kwaapfila ng'atulumbilile bae mna ukwighoda kwetu. Twetwe iwo itulongole kuwaghalila Imbuli Inoghile ya Kiristu. <verse number="15" style="v"/>ng'atwighodela sang'ano tsawatendile iwanu wangi kubita chipimo chayatwikile Imulungu, lekeni twololela ghendo ka ukutoghola kwenu kutsakongetseka, tudahe kusang'ana ng'onde ng'ulu mghati mwenu kwa chipimo chayekile Imulungu. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Kuya twodaha kupeta Imbuli Inoghile mna isi tsingi. Kwaapfila ng'atubama bae kwighodela ing'onde iisang'anighwe mne isi ya imunu yungi.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v"/>Lekeni ka pfagholonga Ghamaandiko Mahenzeluka. “Iyobama kwighoda, yeghodele achila chayatendile Imtwatsa.” <verse number="18" style="v"/>Kwaapfila iyotogholighwa si yula bae iyetunya imwenyegho, ila ayula iyetunyighwa ne Imtwatsa.</para>
  <chapter number="11" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Pauli ne iwatumighwa we ughutsu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Nobama mnidudumile chidogho, hata ka nakoneka na mbotsi! Nidudumileni chidogho. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Nowonela chepfu, lekeni chepfu cha Imulungu, kwaapfila mwemwe ka mwali yanoghile yang'awasile ne mmale yanimlapfile tsengele kwa immale yumwe yaliyeka, iyo Kiristu. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Lekeni nopfuka, ka inzoka pfayamghutsukile Eva, tsimbutsi tsenu tsodaha kughutsukighwa, namwe mtsoleka wenyepfale wenu wa kweli kwa Kiristu. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Mana mwomdudumila imunu yungi iyakutsa kuna mwemwe aku kompetelani Yesu yungi kubita ayuno yatumpeta twetwe. Namwe mwombokela muhe ungi na si Ghumuhe Mwenzeluka yula yamumbokele, kuya mwobokela imbuli inoghile ingi na si Imbuli ila Inoghile yampetelighwe.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>Nene sibona bae ka namdodo kubita awo iwekema iwenyegho watumighwa wakulu. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Hata ka sidahile bae kulonga pfinoghile, lekeni nina chisomo, chinu chino tuchitenda ghamanyike ghendo kuna mwemwe, chila hanu na ghamatsuwa ghose.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v"/>Pfii notenda nzambi hanihulumsa mwenyegho na kuwenulani mwemwe kwa kuwapetela hela Imbuli Inoghile ye Imulungu? <verse number="8" style="v"/>Tsanikala ka noghaboka makingili ghangi ghe iwanu we Imulungu kwa kusola pfinu pfawo, ndahe kuwasang'anila mwemwe. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Na hanikalile namwe simtsupfile imunu wowose hanibamile chinu, kwaapfila iwandughu iwalawile Makedoniya tsawangaya ghose ghanibamile. Sibamile bae niwalombeni mwemwe kwa chinu chochose chila, na noghendelela kutenda apfo. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Kwa kweli ya Kiristu ili mghati mwangu, kuduhu imunu wowose iyali mna isi ya Akaya yatsongoma nene ndeke kwighoda. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Pfii kwaapfila siwanoghela bae? Imulungu komanya ka nene nowanoghela!</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>Nitsoghendelela kutenda achila chanitenda sambi, ili ndeke kuweng'a nyafasi awala iwekema iwenyegho watumighwa wakulu, awala iwobama nyafasi yo ukwighoda ka wawo nawo wotenda sang'ano ka twetwe. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Mana iwanu awo watumighwa wa ughutsu, wasang'ani wa ughutsu iwetenda iwenyegho woneke ka watumighwa wa Kiristu. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Mleke kukangawala, mana hata Setani imwenyegho kodaha kwitenda yoneke ka malaika wa ghumwanga. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Apfo si chinu cha kukangawatsa bae hata watumwa wa Setani wang'etenda iwenyegho woneke ka watumwa iwanoghile, lekeni mne utsighilo wawo watsobokela ka pfawasang'ane.</para>
  <para style="s">Pauli keghodela ghamaghayo ghayapatile</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>Nolonga keli, imunu wowose yandeke kumbona ka nene na mbotsi. Lekeni mng'ambona apfo, mmbokele pfipfo ka nene na mbotsi, ili nidahe kwighoda chidogho. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Chanilonga sambi si achila chayobama Imtwatsa nonge, lekeni kwa mbuli ino ye kwighoda, nene nolonga ka na mbotsi. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Kwaapfila iwanu wengi weghoda ka iwanu we isi pfaweghoda, na nene notenda pfipfo. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Mwemwe muwenyegho mna nzewele, ndo mana mwowadudumila iwabotsi kwa kudeng'elela! <verse number="20" style="v"/>Mwomdudumila hata imunu yula iyomtendani watumwa, iyoboka pfinu pfenu, na iyetunya na iyomtsabeni mpfihanga. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Nakona chinyala kutoghola ka agho twetwe ng'atughadahile bae kughatenda.</para>
  <para style="p">Kuya pfopfose pfaikuwa, ka hana imunu wowose yobama kwighodela chinu, nolonga ka na mbotsi, nani noghetsa kwighoda. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Angu wawo Waebulaniya? Nani pfipfila na mwebulaniya. Pfii wawo Waisiraeli? Nani pfipfila na muisiraeli. Pfii wawo wolawa mlukolo lwa Abrahamu? Nani pfipfila nolawa mlukolo lwa Abrahamu. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Wawo wamsang'anila Kiristu? Nolonga ka nina lukwale, nene namtumighwa yanoghile kubita wawo! Nisang'ana ng'onde ng'omu kubita wawo, nyohighwa kubita wawo, nifapulighwa kubita wawo, na ng'ala habehi yakufa kubita wawo. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Tsanifapulighwa mala tano pfiboko 39 pfa Wayahudi. <verse number="25" style="v"/>Tsanitowighwa mala ndatu na Waroma, tsanitowighwa na mabwe mala lumwe, mnumbwi tsaunibenekela mala ndatu mwibahali, ng'ala meso mmatsi chilo na misi. <verse number="26" style="v"/>Tsanyanga mala nyingi. Tsambama kukululuka na ghamatsi, kutohighwa na wabapfi, kutohighwa na Wayahudi weyangu na Iwanu si Wayahudi bae, nighanzika mkaye, nighanzika mbagho, nighanzika mwibahali, ndununzighwa na sale we ughutsu. <verse number="27" style="v"/>Tsanisang'ana ng'onde ng'ulu na kughanzika, siwasile bae, tsambona nzala na ng'ilu, tsanikala nahela chijo, tsambona beho aku nahela maghwanda. <verse number="28" style="v"/>Kubita agho ghose, chila litsuwa nosang'ana ng'onde ketseketse tsa ghamakingili ghose ghe iwanu we Imulungu. <verse number="29" style="v"/>Ka imunu kahela ngupfu na nene nakuwa ka nahela ngupfu. Imunu wowose ang'alongotsighwa mnzambi, nene pfipfila nakona usungu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v"/>Ning'eghoda, neghodela aghala igholangusa pfanilihela ngupfu. <verse number="31" style="v"/>Imulungu, Aba we Imtwatsa Yesu iyo yatunyighwe ghamatsuwa ghose; yeye komanya ka chanilonga sighutsuka bae. <verse number="32" style="v"/>Haning'ali Damasko, mkulu wa kaye, iyali hasi he imndewa Areta, keka iwanu hane mibani ye isi wangoghe. <verse number="33" style="v"/>Lekeni tsanikighwa mghati mwe linang'ulo, nihulumsighwa kubitila chonzo ichili mbanda, nitsuma kulawa hana yeye.</para>
  <chapter number="12" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Ughubulo na ghamaono gha Pauli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>
    <note caller="+" style="f">
      <char style="fr" closed="false">12.1 </char>
      <char style="ft" closed="false">Hano Paulo kolonga mbuli tsake mwenyegho</char>
    </note>Nene noghendelela kwighoda hata ka ng'apfinoghile bae, nitsolonga aghala ghandawilighwe ne Imtwatsa na aghala ghanighubulile. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Tsanimmanya imunu yumwe iyamtoghole Kiristu, miyaka kumi na mine (14) ipfosile tsakenulighwa mbaka kulanga<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12.2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Chigiriki cholonga ‘ulanga wa kadatu’ lola mstari wa 3</char></note>, lekeni simanyile bae ka kakala ako kwa lukuli au kwa ghumuhe. Imulungu mwenyegho komanya. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Nomanya ka imunu ayo tsakasolighwa mbaka kulanga, lekeni simmanyile bae ka kakala ako kwa lukuli au kwa ghumuhe. Imulungu mwenyegho komanya, <verse number="4" style="v"/>ako yeye kahulika ipfinu ing'apfilongeka bae, ipfinu apfo imunu ng'obamighwa bae yalonge. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Nitseghodela imunu ka ayo, lekeni sitseghodela mwenyegho, ila nitseghoda kwa pfinu pfila ipfilangusa pfanilihela ngupfu. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Ning'abamile kwighoda, ning'awile si mbotsi bae, kwaapfila ning'alongese. Lekeni tsangoma mwenyegho, ili iwanu waleke kumbona ka namkulu kubita aghala ghawakona na kuhulika kulawa kuna nene.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v"/>Ili ipfinu pfikulu pfangubulighwe pfileke kunenda nighode, tsaning'ighwa usungu mkulu mlukuli ka nihomighwa na luhonga, imsenga wa Setani konidudunza ili ndeke kwighoda ng'ani. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Tsanimlomba Imtwatsa mala ndatu ili chinu acho chindawe. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Lekeni yeye kanongela, “uluso wangu wakwenela, kwaapfila ingupfu yangu yokuwa ng'ulu ghendo hala haulihela ngupfu.” Apfo nitseghoda kwa kudeng'elela pfanihungukighwe ngupfu ili ngupfu ya Kiristu ikale mchanya mwangu. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Apfo kwaajili ya Kiristu, nodeng'elela hanikala nahela ngupfu, hanilighighwa, hanighanzika, hanighaya. Kwaapfila hanikala nahela ngupfu, baho nakuwa na ngupfu.</para>
  <para style="s">Pauli kobama kuwapfila iwanu wa Korinto</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>Niwa ka mbotsi, lekeni mwemwe yamninanahitse niwe apfo, mwemwe iwo imbamighwe kunitoghola. Kwaapfila hata ka nene si chinu bae, lekeni sili mdodo bae mna awala iwekema iwenyegho “iwatumighwa wakulu.” <verse number="12" style="v"/>Pfihulo na pfinu pfa kukangawatsa ipfilangusa ka nene na imtumighwa tsapfitendighwa mghati mwenu kwa kududumila ghendo. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Kwaapfila chinu chachi chamuhungukighwe kubita makanisa ghangi, ila nene siwatsupfile bae kwa kubama mwemwe mnyapfile? Mnilekelele kwa acho chihile chaniwatendile!</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>Mlole aluno lwa kadatu nene niyandaa kumwangilani, na sitsokuwa mtsigho bae kuna mwemwe. Sibama bae ipfinu pfenu, ila nowabamani mwemwe, kwaapfila iwana ng'awowekela hatsina iwelesi wawo, ila welesi wowekila iwana wawo. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Nitsodeng'elela sideke kulapfa pfose pfanilinapfo, hata kwilapfa mwenyegho ili kumwapfilani mwemwe, angu mtsoninoghela chidogho kwaapfila nowanoghelani ng'ani?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>Apfo mtsotoghola ka nene siwile mtsigho bae kuna mwemwe. Lekeni imunu yumwe katsolonga, “Kwaapfila Pauli kakengela, tsakawapata kwa kuwaghutsukila.” <verse number="17" style="v"/>Angu nene tsaniwaboka chinu ahala hanimtumile imunu wowose kuna mwemwe? <verse number="18" style="v"/>Tsanimlomba Tito, nimtuma yatse kuna mwemwe hamwe na ndughu yetu yungi. Angu Tito kawaboka pfinu pfenu? Angu yeye na nene ng'atusang'ane bae kwa ghumoyo ghughula au ng'atuwinzile bae nzila ihila imwe?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v"/>Angu mwokwalangula mbaka sambi ka tweyamila wenyegho hambele henu? Twetwe twolonga hambele he Imulungu ka twa iwanu wa Kiristu. Sale tsangu, chochose chotusang'ana, twosang'ana kumwing'ani mwemwe ingupfu. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Kwaapfila nopfuka hala hanikutsa kuna mwemwe ndeke kuwapfika si ka pfanibama kuwonani, namwe ng'amtsombona bae ka pfambama kumbona. Nopfuka kwaapfila kutsolawila ukwisonga, chepfu, ughobo, ukwihisanya, ung'enye, ukwighoda, maya, ukwighola na hengele, <verse number="21" style="v"/>Nopfuka kwaapfila hanitsakutsa keli Imulungu wangu katsonenda nihole hambele henu, na nitsowalilila awala iwatendile nzambi kulawa mwanduso, lekeni ng'awatoghole bae kuleka nzambi tsawo, dong'o tsawo na ughoni wawautendile.</para>
  <chapter number="13" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Ndamso tsa utsighilo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Aluno lelo lwakadatu kumwangilani. “Chila lighomba lihighighwe aku kuwe ne iwanu wabili au wadatu iwonile,” ka Ghamaandiko Mahenzeluka pfogholonga. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Tsanyanza kumkanyeni hanitsile lwakeli kuna mwemwe, na sambi nolonga keli aku nakutali. Hanitsakutsa sitsowonela libatsi awala iwalongole kutenda nzambi na weyawo wose, <verse number="3" style="v"/>namwe mtsolola iwenyegho ka Kiristu kolonga kubitila nene, naye si ka kahela ngupfu bae kuna mwemwe, ila kana ngupfu mna mwemwe. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Mana hata ka tsakawambighwa aku kahela ngupfu, lekeni sambi ka mghima kwe ngupfu ye Imulungu. Pfipfila twetwe twahela ngupfu kwa ukwilunga naye lekeni tutsokala naye kwa ngupfu ye Imulungu kuwasang'anilani mwemwe.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>Mwilolese wenyegho mlole ka kweli mwotoghola, pfii ng'ammanyile bae ka Yesu Kiristu ka mghati mwenu? Ka Kiristu ng'ali mghati mwenu, mhumighwa ghendo! <verse number="6" style="v"/>Lekeni nololela mwemwe mtsotanga ka twetwe ng'atuhumighwe bae. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Sambi twomlomba Imulungu mleke kutenda lyolyose lihile, lekeni si kwaapfila twoneke ne iwanu ka tuhuma lighetso, ila mdahe kutenda aghala ghanoghile, hata ka twetwe twakoneka ng'atuhumile bae. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Mana ng'atudaha bae kutenda chochose kupinga ukweli, ila kughendeletsa. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Twodeng'elela ka twahela ngupfu, lekeni mwemwe mna ngupfu, kuya twomlomba Imulungu mwemwe mnoghe kwa chila chinu. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Kwaajili ayo nakwandika ghano ghose hanili kutali, ili hanikutsa ndeke kuwa mkali kwa ukulu wanying'ighwe ne Imtwatsa wa kuwatsengani na si wa kumbomolani bae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>Ndughu tsangu lelo nowaagha, muwe wanoghile kwa chila chinu, mwalangule chinu chimwe, ghakindeni ghose ghaniwalongele, kaleni bila kwisonga, na Imulungu wa unoghelo na tindiwalo katsokala namwe.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>Mwilamse kwa kulangusa unoghelo wa Kiristu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>Iwanu wose we Imulungu wowalamsani. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Uluso we Imtwatsa Yesu Kiristu na unoghelo we Imulungu na ukwilunga kwe Ghumuhe we Imulungu pfikale namwe mwose.</para>
</usx>
